#   registry <name> <version> <buffer> <node_count> <provider_count>
#   record <registry> <bit> <account_hex32> <x_hex32> <y_hex32>   (absent bit = hole)
#   case <name> <registry> <bitmap_hex32> <required> <s_hex32> <commitment_hex20>
#        <provider_id> <verify> <provenance>
# Every case shares the `payload` line (VALUE, SOURCE_ID and TIMESTAMP of tests/fixtures/mod.rs); its
# registry version is the registry's. `verify` is the outcome of verify(), `provenance` of verify_provenance()
